Operation Mincemeat is a war, history, drama film directed by John Madden.

3
00:20:12,631 --> 00:20:18,631
In 1943, two British intelligence officers concoct Operation Mincemeat, wherein their plan to drop a corpse with false papers off the coast
of Spain would fool Nazi spies into believing the Allied forces were planning to attack by way of Greece rather than Sicily.

