10
01:07:22,105 --> 01:07:28,105
Operation Mincemeat, subtitled The True Spy Story that Changed the Course of
World War II, is a 2021 war drama film directed by John Madden.

11
01:14:06,315 --> 01:14:12,315
It is based upon Ben Macintyre's 2010 book, also called Operation Mincemeat, on
the British Operation Mincemeat during the Second World War.

12
01:20:50,526 --> 01:20:56,526
The film stars Colin Firth, Kelly Macdonald, Matthew Macfadyen, James
Fleet, Penelope Wilton, Johnny Flynn and Jason Isaacs.

13
01:27:34,736 --> 01:27:40,736
This was Paul Ritter's final film appearance, and was dedicated to his memory.

14
01:34:18,947 --> 01:34:24,947
Operation Mincemeat had its world premiere at the 2021 British Film Festival in Australia,
and was released in the United Kingdom on 15 April 2022 by Warner Bros.

15
01:41:03,157 --> 01:41:09,157
It was released on Netflix in North American and
South American countries on 11 May 2022.

16
01:47:47,368 --> 01:47:53,368
The film received generally positive reviews from critics and grossed
$15.7 million worldwide against a $6.3 million budget.

17
01:54:31,578 --> 01:54:37,578
The film explores themes of sicily, italy, spy, world
war ii, based on true story, remake.

